{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'ABBVIE INC. APPROVES AN AMENDMENTS TO ITS BY-LAWS', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 17, 2019, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”) OF ABBVIE INC. APPROVED AND ADOPTED AMENDED AND RESTATED BY-LAWS TO AMEND ARTICLE V, SECTIONS 5.1 AND 5.2 TO ADD VICE CHAIRMAN AS A CATEGORY OF OFFICERS OF THE COMPANY AND TO ADD SENIOR VICE PRESIDENTS AS A CATEGORY OF OFFICERS WHO MAY BE APPOINTED BY THE CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD. ARTICLE I WAS ALSO AMENDED TO REFLECT AN UPDATE TO THE COMPANY’S REGISTERED AGENT AND REGISTERED OFFICE.'}